@startuml deploiement-poc
!include _style.puml
title Déploiement du POC : projet Compose sae-poc, ports interne ➔ hôte (127.0.0.1)

package "Réseau Docker interne" as net {
  package "Sans profil" as base {
    node "kafka\n9092 ➔ 29092" as kafka
    node "minio\n9000 ➔ 19000 (API)\n9001 ➔ 19001 (console)" as minio
    node "clickhouse\n8123 ➔ 18123" as ch
    node "spark-master\n7077\n8080 ➔ 18080" as master
    node "spark-worker-1\n18081 ➔ 18081" as w1
    node "spark-worker-2\n18082 ➔ 18082" as w2
  }
  package "Profil pipeline" as pipe {
    node "producer" as prod
    node "streaming\nspark-submit, mode client\n14040 ➔ 14040" as stream
    node "dashboard-api\nGunicorn (WSGI)\n8000 (pas de port hôte)" as api
    node "dashboard\nnginx non root, page compilée\n8080 ➔ 8501 (seul port de restitution)" as dash
  }
}

prod --> kafka
kafka --> stream
stream --> master
master --> w1
master --> w2
stream --> minio
stream --> ch
ch --> api
dash --> api : /api/

note bottom of base
  Les conteneurs d'initialisation (buckets, tables, topic)
  n'ont pas de profil.
  Budget : environ 12,6 Gio de RAM (limites par conteneur,
  infra/AGENTS.md).
end note

note bottom of pipe
  Volumes en lecture seule : src/streaming sur /opt/streaming
  (conteneurs Spark), ressources/lexique sur /opt/lexique
  (Spark) et /app/lexique (dashboard-api). Volume nommé
  facultatif du producteur : /data (curseur).
end note

note bottom of net
  Tous les ports hôte sont liés à 127.0.0.1.
end note
@enduml
